  "88582": "Explaining what Mark OK covers, on the three phone screens",
  "88540": "Lines are kept if the note or Audit Log fails, deleted records handled",
  "154645": "Verdicts never rely on colour alone, and colours work in the dark theme",
  "88521": "Build lines is hidden, not greyed out, until the inspection is ready",
  "88575": "The customer report stays correct when regenerated or republished",
  "88522": "Building lines when the work order is deleted, built twice, or reopened",
  "88578": "On a phone: reference files, outstanding work and the back button",
  "88552": "Filling: verdict colours, the worst verdict wins, and the truck diagram",
  "154644": "With the feature switch off, none of the new inspection screens show",
  "88550": "Building a template: editing axle rows, reference file and axle count",
  "88536": "Row build with a deleted work order, per row, or a row you can't start",
  "88525": "The note's Build lines is hidden until the inspection is ready",
  "88558": "The technician opens the attached file, unsupported types offer download",
  "88548": "ShopCoach with no results, failures, leaving the page and several axles",
  "88587": "Filling: the Instruction word, and where and when it opens",
  "88544": "Proposed lines arrive ticked, editable and traceable, in a window on a phone",
  "88512": "Photo required: what it does not apply to, and unusual cases",
  "88530": "How findings are counted, once per axle",
  "88509": "Note required: what it does not apply to, and unusual cases",
