  "88541": "What ShopCoach is told about the inspection findings",
  "88524": "Building again asks to confirm, based on the inspection as it is now",
  "88527": "Inspections tab columns: status, findings, work order, report and action",
  "88586": "Building a template: the canvas row, explanations and file labels",
  "88569": "Templates list, per-axle starters, the Axles control and required fields",
